### Agent tooling (F-065)
# These are personal workflow files. They add noise to a public repository, they publish
# internal planning documents, and they advertise AI provider key names that QueueBox does not
# need. The files stay on disk. Version control does not carry them.
.taskmaster/
.cursor/
.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md

# Benchmark output. The small per-run result files are committed; the raw event files,
# logs, configurations and capture state of a run are not.
benchmarks/results/*
!benchmarks/results/*.result.json

# The client library work order. It is a working document for the next effort, not part of the
# shipped documentation.
client-libs-doc.md
